=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ VFTP @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt VFTP @VERSION@ for OpenVMS (vms-vftp): full-screen FTP, SFTP and SCP client, early test
1 'NOTICE
=prompt VFTP is distributed under the MIT licence; libssh2 in it under BSD-3-Clause. Early test release.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [VFTP]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for VFTP (vms-vftp)
    At boot, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:VFTP$STARTUP.COM
    For users, in SYS$MANAGER:SYLOGIN.COM or a LOGIN.COM (defines VFTP):
    $ @VFTP$ROOT:[000000]VFTP$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE VFTP deassigns VFTP$ROOT and VFTP. Users' sites files, logs,
known_hosts and known_tls in SYS$LOGIN are not touched.
